{"id":"637065","name":"捞汁小海鲜","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637065/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲍鱼","amount":"6只"},{"name":"虾","amount":"400克"},{"name":"蛏子","amount":"500克"},{"name":"花甲","amount":"500克"},{"name":"鱿鱼须","amount":"400克"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"柠檬","amount":"一个"},{"name":"冰块","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好海鲜类。","img":"images/637065/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"全部处理好，清洗干净，鲍鱼打花刀。","img":"images/637065/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大蒜头切成末、米椒切成小圈圈+辣椒面+白芝麻。","img":"images/637065/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"浇上热油。","img":"images/637065/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/637065/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/637065/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加盐、糖、鸡精、香油、蚝油、辣椒油、蒸鱼豉油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/637065/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入两大碗凉白开，搅拌均匀，待用。","img":"images/637065/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"起锅加水。","img":"images/637065/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入花甲、蛏子，料酒去腥。","img":"images/637065/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入基围虾，加姜片和葱，焯水，煮2分钟。","img":"images/637065/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"捞出，过凉水，清洗干净。","img":"images/637065/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"鲍鱼和鱿鱼须加姜片、葱、料酒，凉水一起下锅煮3分钟。","img":"images/637065/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"过凉水，清洗干净。","img":"images/637065/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"所有的小海鲜加适量的冰水和冰块泡一下。","img":"images/637065/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"捞出，摆入盘中。","img":"images/637065/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"加入香菜段和柠檬片(柠檬切片去籽)。","img":"images/637065/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"倒入之前调好的汁水。","img":"images/637065/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放入冰箱冷藏半小时左右再吃。","img":"images/637065/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/637065/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637065/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}